217 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 144 0 R
/E (Another basic principle is pairwise majority rule.[1] That is, if the majority of participants prefers item A to item B, then the common ordering should also rank item A higher than item B. Stacker News currently doesn't seem to satisfy this, because a small set of highly motivated zappers/downzappers can boost broadly unpopular posts to the top, or shoot broadly popular posts to the bottom.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [22 351 0 R 23]
>>
endobj
